<noscript><style>form.antibot * :not(.antibot-message) { display: none !important; }</style>
</noscript><meta name="description" content="Adtralza is a medicine for treating adults and children above 12 years of age with moderate to severe atopic dermatitis (also known as eczema, when the skin is itchy, red and dry). It is used in patients for whom treatment applied directly to the skin cannot be used or is not sufficient. Adtralza contains the active substance tralokinumab." />
