>
<span>Other information about Adtralza</span>
</button>          </h3>
                              <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="collapse-bcl-accordion-7" aria-labelledby="heading-bcl-accordion-7" role="region">
            <div class="accordion-body">
                            <div class="ema-faq__body ecl-editor"><p>Adtralza received a marketing authorisation valid throughout the EU on 17 June 2021.</p>
</div>            </div>
